[statement]
As `a-requested-name-with-one-candidate-is-settled-first`, with `p3` also
providing `y`: `y` has two candidates, and the names are decided in order,
`x` first, for `p1`.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:x y=1
k:10

P:p3
V:1
p:y=1

[request]
x
y

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
install p2 1
